{"id": "section-body-17039", "title": "Endodontic treatment/ root canal treatment", "chapterId": "chapter-sixteen", "blocks": [{"id": "body-17039", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading2", "text": "Endodontic treatment/ root canal treatment", "runs": [{"text": "Endodontic"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "treatment/"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "root"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "canal"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "treatment"}], "level": 2, "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "1146"}}, {"id": "body-17040", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Endodontic treatment or root canal treatment is a dental procedure used to repair and save a badly damaged or infected tooth. It involves removing the infected or damaged pulp from tooth’s root canals, cleaning and disinfecting the area, and then filling and sealing it. This procedure aims to eliminate infection and protect the tooth from future microbial invasion, ultimately saving the tooth from extraction.", "runs": [{"text": "Endodontic"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "treatment"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "root"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "canal"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "treatment"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "dental"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "procedure"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "used"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "repair"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "save"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "badly"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "damaged"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "infected"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "tooth. It involves removing the infected or damaged pulp from tooth’s root canals, cleaning and disinfecting the area, and then filling and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "sealing"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "it."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "This"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "procedure"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "aims"}, {"text": " "}, {"text"